#HELPS
-1 REFUGE_CHANGES~
12.15.04 - Mobs were set up as scavenger and had a rand_prog 40 to drop the
           dull piece of iron.  This allowed the iron to be randomly located
           in Refuge Tribe.  Many were wielding it and the iron was
           disappearing.  Changed it from a rand_prog to a death_prog 10.
           death_prog is only set to male villagers as female villagers carry
           gold rings. (Mag)
         - Remove scavenger flag from all mobs. (Mag)
         - Replaced all mpjunk(itemname) with mpjunk i#####. (Mag)
         - Fixed 55 spelling errors. (Mag)
~
-1 REFUGETRIBE LOLO 'REFUGE TRIBE' REFUGE_TRIBE REFUGE~
REFUGE TRIBE
The area is called Refuge Tribe. It is the first area I have ever made, so
comments are welcome and please finger lele for my e-mail address.  English is
my second language so don't tell me if you find some spelling errors or grammar
mistakes; I won't spend time to correct them. I think this area is pretty...
ahem... good. 

      (A) The Story 
      (B) Equipment
      (C) Quests
      (D) Advice
      (E) Current Location
      (F) Revisions -- Aug/Dec 98
      (-) Back

       {171}Updated in August, 1998 by SuperDave{300}
       {171}Updated on December 29, 1998 by Emperor{300}

{-}GAMEAREA1
{f}REFTRIBE6
{e}REFTRIBE5
{d}REFTRIBE4
{c}REFTRIBE3
{b}REFTRIBE2
{a}REFTRIBE1
~
-1 REFTRIBE1~
THE STORY
As mentioned by Hiho in his book, all the residents here are originally
refugees from the Kingdom of Dilemma. They fled because they were all
peace-loving people. After a thousand years of development, the tribe had
become one of the most advanced and populated cities in the realms. That caught
Chaos' attention and he sent out troops to destroy this peaceful city. However,
the military leader of the village, C. Slayer, with the help of Order, was
able to save the town from Chaos' troops of destruction. This time, Chaos
sent out yet another troop of minions who were determined to destroy the
whole city. If they should fail the mission, they would make sure the two
leaders of the town, Hiho and Slayer, were killed. 

Now at this critical time, a hero walked through the gate.... YOU!! The
future of this city is now up to you. Can you save it?

~
-1 REFTRIBE2~
EQUIPMENT
There is eq for low and high level players in Refuge Tribe. For high level
players there are two sets of armor and weapons that have the same stats.
I just think this mud doesn't have much good armors for evil people so I
made the evil armors more easy to get. Although all high level eq is
unique, you have to go through a quest to get the good armor. For the evil
armor you just go in and kill the boss.
~
-1 REFTRIBE3~
QUESTS
There are several little quests in the village:
1. Rob the bank and get cash and some cool equipment.
2. Get Slayer out of the safe room so you can kill him.
3  The easiest quest probably will be this one. Find a good piece of iron and
   let Porky the blacksmith make some equipment for you.
4. Get a cool enchanted rune of magical ability. 
~
-1 REFTRIBE4~
ADVICE
All players can set their death room in the village, you will need to find
out the exact location for yourselves. I personally don't like mazes too
much so I am proud to say that in my area there are absolutely no mazes.
If you seem to be going in a circle then well, you are not. If you think
you are lost, you are not. If you go in one direction, you will either
find a way out, or a dead end.
~
-1 REFTRIBE5~
LOCATION
See the help file on roads to find out the exact location. You can
also fly to refuge from Chakkor, Midgaard and the City of Sarglam via the 
oh-so-convenient Griffon Airlines.
~
-1 REFTRIBE6~
REVISIONS
This hopefully is my last revision/addition for this area. I will fix bugs
in the area but no more additions.  All ideas suggestions or whatever
will appear in my next area, the Kingdom of Dilemma, which is planned to
be finished... well, in the near future. The story of this area is 
completed. Lolo 'April 96

     Fixed some bugs and made a few changes  SD Aug 98
     Fixed typos and quest bugs and other cosmetics  Emperor Dec 98
~
0 $~




