>give_prog I14878~
if quest (5,3,$n)== 3
  mpmset $n quest 5 3 4
  mpjunk i14878
  mpecho $I laughs loudly.
  mpoload 14819
  hold gem
  say Where did you get this?
else
  say Why are you giving me this junk?
  sigh $n
  give i14878 $n
endif
~
